From 8e6a2f5d5fe069f6b0fc124febcadb3f147ed0f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:04:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure snapshot activation, validation and
 directory lifecycle

Give 26 existing Info diagnostics stable event names and typed snapshot
commitments, block hashes, heights, coin counts, directory paths and errors.
Keep full block-index descriptions separate from block hashes. Copy the
AssumeutxoHash commitment's original 32 bytes without parsing a string.
Preserve human wording, validation decisions, cache policy, locks, error
returns, snapshot serialization and directory operations.

The focused functional control rejects owned snapshots with unregistered
base commitments through the existing outer guard. It then stages only a
real-genesis base-hash marker in its own empty snapshot directory and uses
the existing explicit reindex-chainstate path to discard it before loading
snapshot coins. It checks unchanged genesis, removal, and typed lifecycle
records. No private helper is exposed and no snapshot consensus is relaxed.
Complete valid snapshot activation and inner population/background failures
are not claimed as newly exercised. Initial fixture assumptions and their
failure receipts are preserved separately.
The known fatal user-error paragraph remains plain logging: its minimum621
characters exceed the entire448-byte structured payload, while the original
logger spills the full message. A later static-template decomposition must
preserve it before this site can be converted.
Four remaining printf floating formats receive integer decimal-MB quotients;
leave those explicitly deferred until consumer rendering equivalence is proven.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py 0.51.0; explicit reviewed catalog):
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/snapshot-chainstate-lifecycle.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/snapshot336-conversion.json --apply
git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/validation.cpp

The catalog and test were manually reviewed. Native compilation and runtime
results are recorded separately rather than inferred from clean replay.

